🎯 Key Points Summary
Google handles authentication - User password Google ke paas rehta hai

We get verified user data - Google email, name, picture deta hai

JWT maintains session - Token se user identify hota hai

MongoDB stores user info - Sirf basic info store karte hain

One button, two actions - Login AND registration automatically handle hota hai

